     "<div dir=\"ltr\">[Oops that last post had an unfortunate error in the code.]<div><br></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px\">There&#39;s a new version of <a href=\"http://kbroman.org/qtl2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://kbroman.org/qtl2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484202844000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1JlmxSdllEc_12t1ve1_iO\">R/qtl2</a> (0.8) with some major changes. We&#39;ve merged the separate packages qtl2geno, qtl2scan, qtl2plot, and qtl2db into a single package,<span> </span></span><a href=\"https://github.com/rqtl/qtl2\" style=\"font-size:14px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/rqtl/qtl2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484202844000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1mwvefOpAkyZFEtdjCZrc0\">qtl2</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px\">. The function names are all the same, just rolled into a single package.</span></font><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">The qtl2convert package (for converting objects among the R/qtl, DOQTL, and R/qtl2 formats) remains a separate package.</font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">To remove the old packages:</font><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"> </span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">remove.packages(paste0(&quot;qtl2&quot;, c(&quot;geno&quot;, &quot;scan&quot;, &quot;plot&quot;, &quot;db&quot;)))</font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">To install the new R/qtl2 package:</font><span style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif\"> </span><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">install.packages(&quot;qtl2&quot;, repos=&quot;<a href=\"https://rqtl.org/qtl2cran\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://rqtl.org/qtl2cran&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484202844000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2OKa0khE3pppraO2XOnXuP\">https://rqtl.org/qtl2cran</a>&quot;)</font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">The<span> </span><a href=\"http://kbroman.org/qtl2/assets/vignettes/user_guide.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://kbroman.org/qtl2/assets/vignettes/user_guide.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484202844000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ogwrfv1hwz963j1h4Ujpi\">user guide</a><span> </span>and<span> </span><a href=\"http://kbroman.org/qtl2/docs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://kbroman.org/qtl2/docs&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792484202844000&amp;usg=AOvVaw02NAPewmgbccWUwxbc-Ct6\">other documentation</a><span> </span>have been revised to reflect the changes.</font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">karl</font></div></div></div>"
